# research harness: raw fetched trip data is large and regenerable
# (scripts/fetch_experiment_data.py); experiments/results/ is NOT excluded --
# those small CSV/JSON/PNG files are the committed research deliverables,
# except the runtime incident db and log the run itself produces.
experiments/data/
experiments/results/*.sqlite
experiments/results/run.log

.env
dbt_project/package-lock.concurrent-update-lock
